WEBVTT

01:40.210 --> 01:43.960
<b>SUGAYA</b>

02:00.920 --> 02:02.710
<b>Natsu! Are you okay?</b>

02:10.540 --> 02:13.290
<b>Jinta...</b>

02:22.290 --> 02:24.540
<b>P-please don't, Jinya.</b>

02:26.420 --> 02:29.380
<b>That demon... he's my father!</b>

02:45.380 --> 02:47.830
<b>You ain't winning like that.</b>

02:48.040 --> 02:50.540
<b>Sorry, but it's time for me to end this.</b>

03:00.790 --> 03:05.460
<b>What a bum deal.
It feels awful killing someone I saw turn demon.</b>

03:09.040 --> 03:13.080
<b>I'm sure he's got things under control,
but I better hurry to help anyways.</b>

03:15.920 --> 03:20.460
<b>'Cuz if I don't... it might leave
a bad taste in my mouth later.</b>

03:29.790 --> 03:31.290
<b>Dammit.</b>

03:57.170 --> 03:59.580
<b>Jinta...</b>

04:05.670 --> 04:07.420
<b>I'm so pathetic.</b>

04:08.380 --> 04:13.500
<b>After all the people that I've killed and devoured
in becoming a demon,</b>

04:14.170 --> 04:18.880
<b>I thought I'd toughened up. At least a little bit.</b>

04:20.790 --> 04:24.380
<b>But now, I'm struggling due to
the human part of my heart I couldn't relinquish.</b>

04:25.880 --> 04:30.170
<b>Why am I always so... spineless?</b>

04:32.250 --> 04:35.920
<b>I'm just... tired...</b>

04:38.380 --> 04:42.500
<b>Perhaps I could find peace
if I simply stopped fighting back.</b>

04:50.880 --> 04:54.540
<b>You and I are truly birds of a feather.</b>

04:55.420 --> 04:57.080
<b>When all's said and done,</b>

04:57.460 --> 05:02.540
<b>we can't help but prioritize how we live our lives
over who we live them with.</b>

05:11.710 --> 05:12.540
<b>YUKI-NO-NAGORI</b>

05:15.040 --> 05:17.540
<b>YUKI-NO-NAGORI</b>

05:21.290 --> 05:24.290
<b>Father, no! Stay way!</b>

05:39.960 --> 05:42.540
<b>J-Jinya...?</b>

05:58.210 --> 06:00.290
<b>That made for a decent shot in the arm.</b>

06:00.830 --> 06:02.880
<b>But it really is too weak.</b>

06:04.080 --> 06:07.790
<b>Guess that's only natural for a sake meant to evoke rage.</b>

06:09.920 --> 06:13.250
<b>God, I hate it.</b>

06:14.250 --> 06:21.790
<b>This damn cowardly heart. My father turns into a demon
and suddenly it wants me to give up the fight.</b>

06:23.540 --> 06:26.500
<b>I hate it so much!</b>

06:47.500 --> 06:53.500
<b>Your wife was raped by a demon and lost her life
to the demonic spawn that she birthed after.</b>

06:54.500 --> 06:57.630
<b>Then your son disappeared alongside that she-devil.</b>

06:58.250 --> 07:01.460
<b>And finally, you ended up turning demon, too.</b>

07:02.960 --> 07:04.630
<b>The irony is staggering.</b>

07:04.830 --> 07:06.290
<b>I need not ask your name.</b>

07:06.540 --> 07:09.170
<b>My duty has bound me to slay demons...</b>

07:09.920 --> 07:11.920
<b>and so, I shall!</b>

07:28.830 --> 07:29.880
<b>Brawn.</b>

07:35.830 --> 07:40.210
<b>The best parting gift I can offer you... is a swift end.</b>

07:40.830 --> 07:43.460
<b>Jinta...</b>

07:44.040 --> 07:48.750
<b>There will be no room for you to suffer.
Just instant death.</b>

07:52.830 --> 07:54.540
<b>I wanted to be stronger.</b>

07:56.380 --> 08:01.380
<b>Because I thought that would enable me
to protect everything.</b>

08:05.580 --> 08:08.750
<b>But if the fates deem otherwise...</b>

08:11.210 --> 08:12.420
<b>Then...</b>

08:13.580 --> 08:16.000
<b>I'll end it myself. All of it!</b>

08:16.170 --> 08:18.250
<b>Jinta!</b>

08:31.960 --> 08:34.670
<b>Goodbye, Father.</b>

09:04.330 --> 09:05.080
<b>Natsu?</b>

09:06.670 --> 09:09.130
<b>What the hell is this?</b>

09:09.580 --> 09:12.630
<b>It's all over now. I'm glad you're okay.</b>

09:14.210 --> 09:15.500
<b>Stay away from me.</b>

09:17.540 --> 09:18.790
<b>My father...</b>

09:20.500 --> 09:22.880
<b>You killed my father!</b>

09:24.210 --> 09:26.290
<b>Get away, you FREAK!</b>

09:34.080 --> 09:35.630
<b>Hey, Jinya!</b>

09:36.790 --> 09:38.830
<b>Looks like you took down a real nasty one.</b>

09:41.920 --> 09:46.540
<b>Honestly... I wish I would've just died fighting instead.</b>

09:47.580 --> 09:50.420
<b>At least then, I don't lose anything.</b>

09:51.380 --> 09:56.580
<b>Hmm. It must've been a pretty damn bleak situation
to make you talk like that.</b>

09:57.130 --> 10:00.750
<b>But hey, if you're still standing,
then it's over and done with, right?</b>

10:01.290 --> 10:03.500
<b>Yeah. It's finished.</b>

10:06.080 --> 10:08.460
<b>Now we just need to uproot the source of the problem.</b>

10:32.380 --> 10:37.170
<b>W-whoa, hold your horses!
Can't ya walk just a wee bit slower?</b>

10:38.130 --> 10:40.830
<b>You're the one who said we needed to hurry, remember?</b>

10:41.040 --> 10:46.500
<b>Okay, fair point. But we've been walkin'
continuously for days now.</b>

10:46.880 --> 10:49.170
<b>And I'm just a regular guy, ya know?</b>

10:49.460 --> 10:51.670
<b>You can't expect me to keep up with you.</b>

11:00.330 --> 11:01.920
<b>Night will fall before we get there.</b>

11:01.920 --> 11:04.630
<b>C'mon, don't harp on me like that.</b>

11:05.250 --> 11:07.880
<b>Besides, we're headin' for the capital of spooksville.</b>

11:08.130 --> 11:10.330
<b>Darkness fits the mood better, ya know?</b>

11:10.880 --> 11:13.080
<b>Speakin' of which, I've been itching to ask...</b>

11:13.380 --> 11:14.170
<b>What?</b>

11:14.420 --> 11:18.790
<b>Well, you've already got a good idea
of what Yuki-no-Nagori really is, don'tcha?</b>

11:21.420 --> 11:25.960
<b>See, I knew it! My gut has been tellin' me as much.</b>

11:26.580 --> 11:28.580
<b>Ya gonna fill me in or what?</b>

11:29.210 --> 11:32.000
<b>Let's start with the basics: How is sake brewed?</b>

11:32.000 --> 11:37.460
<b>Hm? Well, ya just make koji mold outta steamed rice
and then chuck it in some water. Right?</b>

11:38.040 --> 11:40.920
<b>That's an incredibly rough summary, but yes.</b>

11:41.830 --> 11:45.420
<b>Now let's take it a step further and assume
that Yuki-no-Nagori was made the same way.</b>

11:45.830 --> 11:49.080
<b>Oh, please! Don't start clownin' around.</b>

11:49.250 --> 11:52.630
<b>How's anybody supposed to get
a spring of sake outta that?</b>

11:52.830 --> 11:56.670
<b>Chucking some koji mold in a fountain
ain't gonna make squat!</b>

11:57.040 --> 11:59.330
<b>Then chuck in something other than koji mold.</b>

12:00.000 --> 12:02.040
<b>There's such a thing as "flavored" liquors.</b>

12:02.380 --> 12:07.750
<b>It involves letting fruits, spices, or herbs soak in the brew
so that their flavors become infused in it.</b>

12:08.500 --> 12:10.830
<b>Ah, I get it now.</b>

12:11.630 --> 12:16.920
<b>So, basically, you're saying this stuff was infused
with somethin' that can turn humans into demons.</b>

12:17.500 --> 12:21.210
<b>And the one responsible for that
is the golden-haired lady.</b>

12:21.790 --> 12:22.580
<b>Yes.</b>

12:23.000 --> 12:28.170
<b>I'm betting the remains of someone who met with an
untimely demise are sitting at the bottom of the spring.</b>

12:35.880 --> 12:39.790
<b>Ugh, no more! I'm freezing, hungry, and it's pitch black!</b>

12:40.040 --> 12:43.080
<b>I'm starting to wonder why I even bothered taggin' along.</b>

12:43.380 --> 12:47.790
<b>You explicitly made the trip from Kyoto in search
of the truth behind Yuki-no-Nagori, didn't you?</b>

12:48.290 --> 12:51.830
<b>Well, yeah, but I didn't think
it would be this much of an ordeal!</b>

12:58.000 --> 13:00.580
<b>Flowers? In the middle of winter?</b>

13:03.040 --> 13:04.250
<b>What's the matter?</b>

13:04.710 --> 13:06.170
<b>Shirayuki poppies...</b>

13:06.500 --> 13:08.790
<b>Huh? Shira-what now?</b>

13:09.630 --> 13:13.960
<b>Somegoro. The first time I tried Yuki-no-Nagori,</b>

13:14.580 --> 13:16.420
<b>it tasted weak to me.</b>

13:18.000 --> 13:19.290
<b>Yet at the same time...</b>

13:19.790 --> 13:21.380
<b>I felt a sense of nostalgia.</b>

13:21.750 --> 13:23.040
<b>Nostalgia?</b>

13:23.710 --> 13:27.040
<b>I just assumed that was natural for a sake born of hatred.</b>

13:28.000 --> 13:31.380
<b>However, the reality may be very different...</b>

13:32.790 --> 13:35.630
<b>Yuki-no-Nagori is remorse from beyond the grave.</b>

13:36.380 --> 13:38.710
<b>It's born from emotions left by the departed.</b>

13:41.250 --> 13:45.710
<b>Feelings strong enough to turn humans
into demons? That's just unsettling.</b>

13:46.420 --> 13:49.040
<b>How much of a grudge did they die
with for that to happen?</b>

13:50.420 --> 13:51.880
<b>Don't look at it that way.</b>

13:52.830 --> 13:55.290
<b>Although it ultimately became
a sake that spawned demons,</b>

13:55.750 --> 13:57.750
<b>that's not what the corpse originally intended.</b>

14:01.750 --> 14:03.040
<b>What's that smell?</b>

14:04.750 --> 14:05.790
<b>Somegoro...</b>

14:06.170 --> 14:10.250
<b>I'm out! I'm gonna stay here and rest.</b>

14:10.250 --> 14:12.210
<b>My legs are killing me.</b>

14:12.420 --> 14:13.290
<b>But...</b>

14:13.290 --> 14:16.420
<b>The rest of the journey isn't meant
for feeble humans like me.</b>

14:18.880 --> 14:19.670
<b>Thanks.</b>

15:13.630 --> 15:15.500
<b>You wanted me to find you here, huh?</b>

15:17.210 --> 15:18.880
<b>You were just waiting.</b>

15:19.920 --> 15:25.380
<b>Goading the hatred inside of people and letting it fester
to the point they became demons...</b>

15:34.000 --> 15:40.040
<b>Because you believed that a demon slayer
would eventually come to put a stop to it.</b>

15:43.670 --> 15:45.250
<b>I had no idea.</b>

15:46.670 --> 15:48.830
<b>So even your body was stolen from you?</b>

15:49.500 --> 15:53.290
<b>Yet in spite of what you've been reduced to...</b>

15:59.040 --> 16:01.210
<b>...you still wish me by your side.</b>

16:21.130 --> 16:23.670
<b>That goes without saying, Jinta.</b>

16:25.670 --> 16:29.500
<b>I'm sorry. I ended up causing you great pain.</b>

16:30.540 --> 16:36.710
<b>I'm a sentinel. It's only customary that I wield my blade
in service to the Itsukihime, right?</b>

16:38.000 --> 16:38.960
<b>Mm-hmm.</b>

16:40.500 --> 16:41.630
<b>Thank you.</b>

16:58.290 --> 17:01.670
<b>Well, so long... Jinta.</b>

17:03.250 --> 17:04.210
<b>Yeah.</b>

17:18.040 --> 17:21.080
<b>Good night, Shirayuki.</b>

17:48.290 --> 17:52.580
<b>Ever since we came back, all the hubbub around
demons and crazy drunks has died down.</b>

17:52.960 --> 17:55.500
<b>I suppose that means this case is closed.</b>

17:58.000 --> 18:04.960
<b>But after ya got rid of the source, all the Yuki-no-Nagori
left in Edo became plain water and caused quite the fuss.</b>

18:05.380 --> 18:09.290
<b>Is that why so many people in Edo seem agitated?</b>

18:09.750 --> 18:13.000
<b>Nah. That's cuz of the political climate.</b>

18:13.130 --> 18:17.500
<b>A lotta bigwigs from our government have been
brown-nosin' with foreign nations lately</b>

18:17.500 --> 18:19.500
<b>and it's got everybody strung out.</b>

18:19.880 --> 18:24.460
<b>But isolationism ain't a policy that can last forever.</b>

18:28.380 --> 18:31.630
<b>The most that you and I can do is slay demons.</b>

18:32.080 --> 18:35.790
<b>There ain't no pushing back
against the march of time, ya know?</b>

18:37.790 --> 18:39.380
<b>You're right.</b>

18:41.630 --> 18:43.710
<b>What's wrong? You look glum.</b>

18:44.580 --> 18:45.670
<b>It's nothing.</b>

18:47.040 --> 18:49.750
<b>I was just thinking about that blonde woman.</b>

18:49.750 --> 18:53.000
<b>Ah, the evil mastermind.</b>

18:53.330 --> 18:56.000
<b>Ya worried she's plottin' something else?</b>

18:56.830 --> 18:57.540
<b>Yes.</b>

18:58.290 --> 19:01.250
<b>Well, there's no sense broodin' over it.</b>

19:04.290 --> 19:07.540
<b>Thanks for the food! I'm leavin' my payment here.</b>

19:08.290 --> 19:10.670
<b>Alrighty, time for me to hit the road.</b>

19:10.960 --> 19:13.330
<b>I've gotta get back before my disciple starts frettin'.</b>

19:14.250 --> 19:15.580
<b>Later, Jinya.</b>

19:16.040 --> 19:18.830
<b>Pay me a visit if ya ever find yourself in Kyoto.</b>

19:19.290 --> 19:22.830
<b>Just tell folks you're lookin' for Somegoro Akitsu
and they'll point'cha in the right direction.</b>

19:23.290 --> 19:25.880
<b>Sure. If the occasion ever arises.</b>

19:27.920 --> 19:29.670
<b>Well, toodle-oo!</b>

19:42.750 --> 19:46.250
<b>Oh, Jinya-kun! It's been a while!</b>

19:46.250 --> 19:48.580
<b>Hey! Good to see ya, pal!</b>

19:48.580 --> 19:51.790
<b>You took an extra long break
from swinging by here for soba, eh?</b>

19:52.080 --> 19:54.380
<b>Yeah. Things got hectic.</b>

19:55.130 --> 19:58.330
<b>We've actually been going through
a drought of customers lately.</b>

19:59.250 --> 20:01.130
<b>So it's great to see you again.</b>

20:02.330 --> 20:05.830
<b>Miura-sama has been stopping by here
for lunch as usual,</b>

20:06.250 --> 20:08.880
<b>but we haven't seen Natsu-san or Zenji-san.</b>

20:09.630 --> 20:14.540
<b>And considering that you haven't been around,
we've just been sitting here twiddling our thumbs.</b>

20:15.460 --> 20:17.250
<b>Order up, one kake-soba!</b>

20:17.250 --> 20:17.960
<b>Okay!</b>

20:21.670 --> 20:23.130
<b>Thank you for waiting.</b>

20:34.170 --> 20:34.960
<b>Chef.</b>

20:35.540 --> 20:36.580
<b>What's on yer mind?</b>

20:37.250 --> 20:39.040
<b>Have you changed your recipe?</b>

20:39.420 --> 20:40.170
<b>Huh?</b>

20:40.710 --> 20:42.750
<b>The broth seems less flavorful.</b>

20:43.210 --> 20:47.290
<b>Uh, well, I made it the same way that I always have...</b>

20:48.460 --> 20:49.250
<b>I see.</b>

20:50.080 --> 20:52.170
<b>Then it must just be my imagination.</b>

20:57.380 --> 20:58.290
<b>Here, my payment.</b>

20:58.500 --> 20:59.250
<b>Right.</b>

21:01.170 --> 21:03.830
<b>Ah. Could you wait a minute, Jinya-kun?</b>

21:04.000 --> 21:04.790
<b>What for?</b>

21:05.080 --> 21:08.080
<b>Allow me to join you for part of your walk home.</b>

21:10.580 --> 21:11.580
<b>Shall we go?</b>

21:19.790 --> 21:21.460
<b>It's gotten chilly.</b>

21:21.790 --> 21:22.540
<b>Yeah.</b>

21:27.580 --> 21:29.170
<b>Are you doing okay?</b>

21:29.580 --> 21:30.670
<b>Why do you ask?</b>

21:31.380 --> 21:33.210
<b>You said things were hectic.</b>

21:33.920 --> 21:36.500
<b>Sorry. Did that make you worry?</b>

21:36.790 --> 21:40.380
<b>A little. You're one of our few regulars, after all.</b>

21:49.580 --> 21:50.630
<b>This is where we part ways.</b>

21:52.210 --> 21:52.920
<b>Okay.</b>

22:02.710 --> 22:03.830
<b>Jinya-kun?</b>

22:04.920 --> 22:07.710
<b>Do you remember about the winter daphnes?</b>

22:23.210 --> 22:24.330
<b>I remember them.</b>

22:25.040 --> 22:27.670
<b>Flowers that bloom after surviving the chill of winter.</b>

22:28.460 --> 22:30.290
<b>The harbingers of spring.</b>

22:33.670 --> 22:38.170
<b>Honestly... where would I be without you?</b>

23:01.420 --> 23:04.290
<b>The snow dyes everything pure white.</b>

23:04.880 --> 23:06.330
<b>Without exception.</b>

23:07.540 --> 23:11.330
<b>Even after it melts and disappears from view,</b>

23:12.130 --> 23:15.000
<b>the frozen chill that it leaves behind is engrained.</b>

23:15.790 --> 23:18.750
<b>Strongly and deeply!</b>

23:23.920 --> 23:26.000
<b>Much akin to hatred.</b>

23:27.040 --> 23:30.960
<b>Your body actually proved to be useful after all.</b>

23:32.790 --> 23:34.080
<b>Good night...</b>

23:35.670 --> 23:36.830
<b>...Princess.</b>
